# Temporal project management documentation
# These patterns match files that violate documentation organization standards
# See .cursor/rules/15-documentation-organization.mdc for details
#
# Note: These patterns will ignore NEW files matching these names.
# Files already tracked in git will need to be removed manually if they violate standards.
# Proper location for temporal docs: docs-status/ (already git-ignored above)
docs-status/

